	(text "BUILD RESISTOR R20 (only part besides the MOSFETs that differs per build).\nVth = 5 V x 10k / (R20 + 10k); ACS770-100U: 0.5 V + 40 mV/A.\n  HC  7.15k -> 2.92 V -> trip 60 A\n  STD 16.2k -> 1.91 V -> trip 35 A\n  HV  35.7k -> 1.10 V -> trip 15 A\nR20 open -> Vth 0 -> always tripped (cannot turn on). PIC reads VTH (BUILD_REF) as the build ID;\nout-of-band reading = fault. While latched VTH reads ~0.3 V (see D20)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bc31e95b-12e4-48bb-96ee-1a3150398d55")
	)
