	(text "VOM1271 LEDs (two in series, on the power-path sheet): +5V -> R27 -> LEDs -> Q21 -> Q22 -> Q23 -> GND.\nCurrent flows only when GATE_EN (firmware) AND TRIP_OK (hardware) are high AND TRIP_RST is low:\n~21 mA ((5 - 2 x 1.4) V / 100 R), giving ~30 uA gate drive. R28 holds GATE_EN low at reset.\nQ23/Q24/R29: while TRIP_RST is high (trip blinded during reset), the gate drive is forced off in\nhardware, so a reset can never coincide with an enabled switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 226.06 154.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1871301-389f-4e51-b049-e14f7275d0d9")
	)
